invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_mont.c
catches: rsa_ifma_model_test
reason: power_of_two_mod runs one step of the division fewer than its
  exponent needs, so rsa_ifma_public gets 2^(104n - 64) mod m and every
  result is off by a factor of 2^64. bin/rsa_ifma_model_test compiles
  rsa_mont.c's dispatch over the lane model and compares rsa_vp1_cpu
  under the bit with rsa_vp1.

--- old
    size_t steps = (exponent >> 6) - (k - 1);
--- new
    size_t steps = (exponent >> 6) - k;
